# Stack-agnostic ignores for the lo-fi-player repository.
# PR #0 is intentionally Go-free; language-specific entries (e.g. `bin/`,
# `vendor/`, `coverage.out`) land alongside the Go module in PR #1.

# --- Operating system clutter ---
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini

# --- Editor / IDE state ---
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace
.project
.classpath
.settings/

# --- Tooling caches (local-dev only) ---
# `.atl/` holds the assistant skill registry cache. It is regenerated per
# machine and must never be committed.
.atl/
.opencode/
.mcp_config*

# --- Secrets / local environment overrides ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
secrets.*

# --- Build / download artefacts (generic, language-agnostic) ---
# Keep this section limited to artefacts that appear before a language
# toolchain is selected. Go-specific entries are added in PR #1.
node_modules/
bower_components/
*.log
*.pid
*.seed
*.pid.lock

# --- Coverage / test reports (placeholder until a runner is chosen) ---
coverage/
*.cover
*.coverage
htmlcov/

# --- OS package outputs ---
*.deb
*.rpm
*.dmg
*.pkg
*.tar.gz
*.zip
